{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1146","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Love \"A\""}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Alice has a string $$$s$$$. She really likes the letter \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". She calls a string good if strictly more than half of the characters in that string are \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"s. For example \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaabb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"axaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are good strings, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"baca"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"awwwa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \"\" (empty string) are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Alice can erase some characters from her string $$$s$$$. She would like to know what is the longest string remaining after erasing some characters (possibly zero) to get a good string. It is guaranteed that the string has at least one \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in it, so the answer always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a string $$$s$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |s| \\leq 50$$$) consisting of lowercase English letters. It is guaranteed that there is at least one \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer, the length of the longest good string that Alice can get after erasing some characters from $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nxaxxxxa\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\naaabaa\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, it's enough to erase any four of the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"s. The answer is $$$3$$$ since that is the maximum number of characters that can remain."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, we don't need to erase any characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1146A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1146/problem/A"}